BBUUGGSS
     Certainly.

     Does not seem to work (reliably) on machines with more than 4GB of main
     memory.  See in the _L_O_A_D_E_R _T_U_N_A_B_L_E_S section above.

     While rrttww8888 supports 802.11a/b/g/n/ac modes, the compatibility code cur‐
     rently only supports 802.11a/b/g modes.  Support for 802.11n/ac is yet to
     come.

